```
package.json
tsconfig.json
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
src/
  shared/
    scene.types.ts      # Square, Scene, zod schemas (shared by server + web)
  server/
    scene.ts            # in-memory scene + addSquares/clear/onChange (pure, testable)
    scene.test.ts
    ws.ts               # WebSocket handler
    mcp.ts              # MCP server + tools, mounted at /mcp
    main.ts             # express app, Vite middleware, wires it all together
  web/
    index.html
    main.tsx
    App.tsx             # reference grid + squares SVG, drag-to-draw with snap, size label, Clear button
    useScene.ts         # WS connection -> current scene
```

A single package for now. Split into workspaces only when a second consumer (e.g. the CLI) shows up.

